            <Title>References</Title>
            <Text>Bank of America Institute. 2026. “On the Ball: How Football Fuels Local Spending.” https://institute.bankofamerica.com/content/dam/economic-insights/football-economics-local-spending-impact.pdf.
Beilby, J. 2026. “Is Football Declining in Popularity? New Poll Reveals Competition.” https://www.usatoday.com/story/sports/nfl/2026/09/17/most-popular-sports-america-football-gallup-2026/91766661007/.
California State University, Sacramento. 2026. “The NFL’s GDP: How Football Drives the U.S. Economy.” https://cmorales.sacsites.csus.edu/the-nfl-s-gdp-how-football-drives-the-u-s-economy.html.
Gibbens, S. 2018. “‘Sea Nomads’ Are First Known Humans Genetically Adapted to Diving.” National Geographic (5).
Worden, R. 2026. “The Projective Wave Theory of Consciousness.” Frontal Psychology. doi:10.3389/fpsyg.2026.1674983.
