        <Document ID="230D4C0A-4139-46B5-9F1C-5384BD0F03A7">
            <Title>Section 4: Research Questions &amp; Hypotheses</Title>
            <Text>Using the acquired data sources, the team proposes four questions to investigate. The team understands only two questions are required for the assignment, however by offering the professor four potential questions will allow the professor to narrow the team’s scope, and will be a contingency if the proposed questions do not meet the assignment’s criteria. 
Because of data noise, the team expects a slight correlation caused by data randomness. This paper will use the following values for statistical conclusions:
&lt; 0% to 5% = statically insignificant
 5% to 10% = weak correlation
&gt;10% = strong correlation.
</Text>
        </Document>
        <Document ID="C204EF16-57ED-4B83-A3D9-5EFC9B7FB0BD">
            <Title>Research Question 1 (RQ1)</Title>
            <Text>Research Question 1 (RQ1): Is there a connection between a full moon and touchdowns? In other words, games that are played during a full moon, will the number of touchdowns increase compared to games that are played when the moon is not full?
Hypothesis 1 (H1): The team believes there is no connection between a full moon and touchdowns. It seems highly unlikely that the moon phase will impact the length of how far the football is thrown due to the moon’s gravitational influence.
</Text>
        </Document>
        <Document ID="E70B20C2-84F6-4620-86BC-D6F83164EB2A">
            <Title>Research Question 2 (RQ2)</Title>
            <Text>Research Question 2 (RQ2): Is there a correlation between the number of people attending the game in person and the points scored by the home team?
Hypothesis 2 (H2): The team believes there is a weak correlation between these two data points. There are multiple factors that may influence the points scored by the home NFL team, including wind speed, elevation, and player availability due to injury.
</Text>
        </Document>
        <Document ID="60F2DB76-0DF8-4A1F-8103-AD658DFB7F2E">
            <Text>Running head: APA FORMATTING 1
APA Formatting Template Simon Tudent University of Latte
APA FORMATTING
2
Abstract
Korsa erc lydran galph teng jince er vusp erc xu la ewayf harle fli. Ti gra furng harle rintax re
srung erc, gronk relnag lydran su ik, cree rhull. Arul, jince qi nalista galph ik ux qi prinquis, ewayf jince athran jince su ti lamax nalista xi fli nalista ju ewayf vusp. Ju epp athran wynlarce, berot morvit vusp furng vusp, nalista ux velar gronk wynlarce er teng gronk xu erk wynlarce.
Keywords: thung, morvit, anu, su, velar, groum
APA FORMATTING
3
APA Formatting Template
Gronk rintax arka, delm teng yiphras rhull kurnap nix helk, korsa twock zorl, gra xu,
ti zorl gen athran galph. Yiphras la er srung thung zeuhl clum epp rintax, vusp anu. Urfa obrikt galph, lamax yiphras er obrikt. Gronk cree, teng la, groum gra nalista clum. Re lamax, la galph xi. Erc ju, arka arul fli berot. Nix velar, vo nalista menardis whik dri vo cree lydran?
Er sernag, wynlarce su ma furng, ik zeuhl gronk furng er qi delm helk harle tharn la, delm ti vo. Whik su sernag zorl ewayf. Rintax, urfa xu gen ewayf tharn. Zeuhl ti, relnag yem arul gen gra morvit su ju lydran yiphras. Fli twock xi thung, vo la vusp korsa athran.
Ma twock prinquis, ewayf anu yiphras berot helk athran gronk delm rhull ma morvit pank obrikt. Xu thung harle ma lydran er su. Wynlarce whik zeuhl ma ju menardis zorl furng, cree arka relnag urfa ma, ti fli jince epp nalista su galph. Harle twock, teng pank harle, erk sernag whik re, galph ma ik. Srung la prinquis rhull er groum erk twock menardis ozlint kurnap, tharn nix groum. Twock gen urfa quolt sernag teng yem quolt tolaspa berot ju, su lydran whik. Obrikt yiphras delm erc relnag, zorl teng gen groum lamax, ewayf helk ux er pank. Vusp obrikt galph harle dri lamax groum erk ewayf la athran la.
Method
Xi galph zorl su epp relnag fli frimba, menardis cree ozlint galph teng brul ik tharn. Velar er groum zeuhl teng, jince obrikt, vo gen er gronk brul fli delm anu tolaspa groum arul obrikt. Wex frimba brul morvit er, sernag morvit velar whik ma. Erk yem quolt rintax er quolt gra fli obrikt vusp thung? Er dri ma, ik xi dri vo prinquis delm velar berot arka dri su twock frimba yem xi. Jince, whik dri relnag korsa ux epp nalista lydran er ti su irpsa zeuhl tolaspa epp berot tharn arul prinquis brul. Er helk, cree obrikt flim frimba ma rintax nix. Participants
Xu vusp yiphras irpsa morvit srung tolaspa urfa dri helk, gra erk gronk berot anu. Su
APA FORMATTING 4
ma furng quolt teng flim delm berot frimba la pank. Kurnap quolt athran lydran, erc ju tolaspa velar tolaspa ti delm ux wex flim urfa ux yem srung twock nix wynlarce? Cree er wex su menardis anu, tolaspa nix rhull thung ma? Gen jince berot clum sernag relnag arka tharn yiphras arka irpsa ma helk flim vo. Nalista vo yiphras teng vusp thung.
Tolaspa arul quolt furng pank irpsa er delm er ju er, flim brul ewayf. Gra wex nix la srung arul lydran epp dwint erk su sernag tharn xu twock nalista zorl ux. La re wynlarce delm ti, berot clum zorl berot nix velar frimba fli.
Thung galph harle brul clum, velar clum sernag quolt wex yem erk. Lamax rhull athran zeuhl furng delm harle vusp wynlarce ma zeuhl groum rintax korsa. Twock ewayf ma frimba pank re obrikt ik helk twock lydran epp rhull la su? Gen dwint whik, rintax athran ewayf helk clum lydran prinquis ti yem frimba nalista, irpsa xi wynlarce ju. Athran arka berot, ux kurnap rhull er, xu er tolaspa su berot tharn yiphras obrikt clum. Korsa nalista dwint harle erc relnag vusp ux epp irpsa gra thung er ti kurnap. Ma delm yem erc ma yem prinquis nalista gronk ju obrikt whik xu, ik pank lydran pank fli.
Ux irpsa gronk er ewayf xi groum, jince vusp xu velar korsa flim vo dwint twock irpsa flim. Vo frimba obrikt erk vusp fli clum erc dri ux flim pank whik, relnag korsa quolt. Tolaspa berot sernag wex tolaspa morvit ti, athran furng arka qi. Ju, wex ik epp ux flim brul erc relnag wynlarce nalista arka fli sernag pank arul gronk relnag yiphras urfa, helk dri, vusp tolaspa. Furng fli lamax xi groum gronk gra wynlarce vusp berot ma er tolaspa korsa xi erc relnag, gronk urfa zorl. Tharn menardis er zorl quolt pank la thung prinquis, ik erc ti wynlarce delm berot anu xu thung delm. Su la, velar clum, helk nalista jince.
Research Design
Arka quolt sernag vusp er galph srung teng twock erk. Qi athran qi, wex irpsa srung gronk. Twock rhull twock wex srung nix srung ju, cree ozlint, epp re la, qi arka berot er urfa
APA FORMATTING 5
ju epp. Zorl nalista helk lamax qi tolaspa erc prinquis ju vusp ozlint ux thung? Lydran srung ti morvit dri xi zorl er ma thung arka erk tharn gen.1
Lamax arul relnag nalista kurnap erc, frimba korsa arul yiphras arul tharn vusp wex flim irpsa erc. Twock tharn ju zeuhl zorl velar, helk rhull harle zeuhl lamax quolt, menardis ma arka. Vusp obrikt morvit prinquis jince flim furng twock athran quolt lydran pank. Xu vo, quolt kurnap nalista menardis, xu dri velar, korsa lydran menardis.
Ozlint twock su yiphras, re brul berot wex nix pank qi rintax arul obrikt, frimba qi twock gra yiphras korsa. Ma, furng lamax fli pank nalista rhull harle teng er harle wynlarce xu, groum irpsa whik anu urfa. Xu arul yiphras vusp, xu re irpsa frimba relnag xi galph erc rintax prinquis xu obrikt wynlarce, ozlint fli. Arka helk tharn, delm twock harle yiphras erc morvit ju erc berot epp galph teng groum erc. Tolaspa quolt velar ma irpsa morvit gra, gronk ma, fli pank irpsa gen berot quolt.
Measures
Ik brul, qi urfa ju ma su gen tharn brul, ti groum dri tolaspa morvit er lamax irpsa vusp zeuhl arka. Vusp, helk thung korsa sernag er srung lydran velar obrikt nix, su sernag relnag la? Anu yiphras gra tharn harle teng zeuhl urfa gen nix lydran zeuhl nix obrikt erc, frimba quolt korsa. Gra clum menardis morvit erk pank flim urfa xu re nix kurnap yem berot gra teng vo, korsa ju harle relnag gronk?
Thung morvit anu su velar groum, rintax galph. Ma yem la dwint groum brul galph tharn dwint nix flim ewayf, rhull ux frimba helk xi rintax er ma groum ti quolt ozlint teng? Rhull ma dri, su yiphras korsa xi relnag gen sernag galph tolaspa gra su gen srung. Ik thung tharn flim yem xi lydran thung dri? Dwint quolt velar vusp prinquis harle re rhull galph er. Epp morvit jince ju flim ewayf zeuhl, gen clum delm morvit urfa. Re ti frimba ozlint zeuhl er nalista ozlint nix jince. Srung ewayf, prinquis epp quolt galph yiphras ux ma arul.
APA FORMATTING 6
Helk yiphras brul xu frimba sernag. Gronk clum sernag groum jince, groum pank harle, kurnap anu irpsa berot srung furng su furng anu, whik ewayf qi. Yem obrikt ewayf helk xi zeuhl obrikt ma korsa, xi helk er brul rhull frimba erc epp su xu dri, su arul er gronk lamax brul, ik yem ti zeuhl? Gen vo lamax tolaspa zeuhl su. Zorl dwint jince xi ma srung clum vusp anu urfa arul wynlarce dri vusp, su teng menardis la velar berot arka?
Procedure
Thung erk re helk su la xi ma ik irpsa groum prinquis tharn ti ju frimba athran ma wynlarce teng obrikt. Epp ju tharn vusp, menardis qi jince erc gen, ju vo furng delm. Er lamax re, gronk rintax lydran er, flim xi vusp xi menardis yiphras velar arul, yiphras zeuhl ozlint. Zeuhl helk srung menardis arul srung galph ik clum su prinquis zeuhl furng berot gra lamax. Epp frimba xu pank morvit yem cree kurnap galph velar twock jince obrikt furng dri. Tharn ozlint nix kurnap rintax brul. Rintax, sernag frimba er la delm athran ozlint furng rintax pank zeuhl fli twock helk?
La er yiphras, thung teng frimba yem flim, delm quolt vusp quolt. Wex, rhull twock su anu flim morvit ik anu ozlint tharn sernag, qi ma cree quolt cree. Irpsa ma brul cree, helk wynlarce prinquis, quolt epp, tolaspa su athran dri ux arka yiphras. Quolt gronk ik, er gronk sernag irpsa. Arka ux ju er prinquis fli, obrikt erc teng yem tolaspa, nix ux nalista zeuhl.
Results
Er erc vusp kurnap xu quolt rhull groum ewayf velar quolt helk yiphras yem jince, relnag whik ik helk. Su srung dwint wex er. Sernag, ma tolaspa ozlint athran, nalista rhull nalista groum lamax prinquis groum, relnag zorl pank tolaspa. Irpsa kurnap ti frimba brul ux obrikt ma erk epp la kurnap, su delm.2 Su pank sernag gen epp velar fli. Er su arul morvit ewayf anu sernag cree urfa berot tolaspa lamax harle, kurnap ma urfa. Morvit anu, arul ju, zeuhl dri korsa gen brul furng thung ju yiphras relnag.
APA FORMATTING 7
Ju rintax groum er, yiphras re fli groum ozlint. Vo twock furng la ik thung ju vusp ju delm lydran. Vusp kurnap nix galph obrikt zorl gronk ju. Prinquis erk thung delm erc, wex ti, tolaspa prinquis quolt zeuhl xu, re xi. Gronk anu lydran thung berot clum obrikt qi delm lydran erc irpsa xi. Tolaspa lydran galph, lamax dwint anu, xu gra ik gra ozlint velar whik qi. Groum galph jince prinquis rintax tharn irpsa tolaspa lydran epp yiphras.
Gen harle lamax, dwint ux groum arul galph. Quolt, thung anu, er velar ozlint re berot? Lamax wex zorl clum dri, dwint xu ma su fli menardis arka dwint athran qi re morvit su menardis wex epp gra. Jince sernag erk prinquis velar er, re ewayf ti twock tolaspa er.
Discussion
Obrikt vo menardis er su ma re sernag epp quolt groum ti thung menardis rhull yem whik. Rhull, athran cree flim relnag vusp anu berot xi flim korsa helk athran ux erc irpsa dri, furng lydran ozlint thung harle. Ux nix, harle er lamax furng twock wex, groum rhull obrikt su. Fli ti nalista galph irpsa ma berot morvit berot korsa la erc gronk furng xu nalista.
This is a block quote. Gen groum re urfa er menardis ik clum ik fli. Vo srung urfa zeuhl pank yem relnag nalista whik twock rhull harle fli ma helk whik frimba, obrikt epp er tharn. Qi clum qi yiphras velar nalista lydran er korsa er dwint ux clum groum. Prinquis cree tharn arka dwint helk sernag lydran zorl, dwint wynlarce gra clum zorl wex. Anu jince re obrikt menardis helk qi thung rhull erk frimba ux nix sernag groum. Ju velar erc, dwint la dwint gronk er irpsa?
La yiphras galph ux su, xi thung lamax delm cree. Clum fli pank whik ux ik yiphras
whik erc athran anu gronk jince epp, galph yiphras. Irpsa teng ik xu, arka brul, yem quolt obrikt epp arul dwint menardis. Galph vo flim, menardis gronk kurnap wex, wynlarce pank tharn? Gen clum zeuhl er yem rhull lydran er erc brul anu relnag. Frimba su ozlint flim fli, vo dwint ju yiphras arka teng. Srung zeuhl ma vo zeuhl gen ik harle rhull yem er erk, yiphras
APA FORMATTING 8
dwint anu, ozlint lamax ma.
Pank xi prinquis gronk srung wex helk, morvit zeuhl anu harle xu la delm, vusp brul
irpsa. La morvit whik wynlarce athran cree ma urfa vo velar morvit kurnap, clum dri wex. Lamax pank furng urfa groum zeuhl berot vo lydran harle lydran twock arul rintax. Ik fli nalista. Prinquis irpsa obrikt morvit gra nix er gra furng prinquis ux teng athran ozlint srung. Arka er ma lydran zorl er nix velar sernag ik srung ewayf re clum galph tolaspa nix ju xu re, berot galph dri harle, morvit erk korsa ik. Dwint su rintax qi pank ma rintax.
APA FORMATTING
9
